cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in a research publication, please cite the FlowBot
  repository or its archived release and acknowledge eLab, Easy-Biologic,
  and biologic-com as specified in the README.
type: software
title: 'FlowBot: Automated Bioelectrocatalysis Screening with Parallel Bio-Logic Electrochemistry'
authors:
  - family-names: Yankson
    given-names: Emmanuel
abstract: >-
  Research software for automated bioelectrocatalysis screening using
  syringe/valve solution handling, shared nitrogen-solenoid purging,
  and three concurrent Bio-Logic electrochemical measurements.
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - electrochemistry
  - bioelectrocatalysis
  - high-throughput screening
  - automation
  - Bio-Logic
  - FlowBot
